                                "sense_id": "3c0feeb8-825e-3ed3-8c0f-b6975ca68425",
                                "text": "There still faintly beamed from the woman's features something of the freshness, and even the prettiness, of her youth; rendering it probable that the personal charms which Tess could boast of were in main part her mother's gift, and therefore unknightly, unhistorical."
                            },
