                                "sense_id": "3c0feeb8-825e-3ed3-8c0f-b6975ca68425",
                                "text": "If one is a liberal, one hopes that this political consciousness will eventually find less costly forms of expression […] But it would be unhistorical to bemoan the protesters' resort to violence […] Movements of social liberation just don't happen that way, much as we might wish they did."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
